msgid ""
"Here the relation pattern is comprised of at least one of the nine relation "
"strings: ``TOUCH``, ``OVERLAPBDYDISJOINT``, ``OVERLAPBDYINTERSECT``, "
"``EQUAL``, ``INSIDE``, ``COVEREDBY``, ``CONTAINS``, ``COVERS``, ``ON``, and "
"``ANYINTERACT``.   Multiple strings may be combined with the logical Boolean "
"operator OR, for example, ``'inside+touch'``. [#fnsdorelate]_  The relation "
"strings are case-insensitive."
msgstr ""
"Här består relationsmönstret av minst en av de nio relationssträngarna: "
"``TOUCH``, ``OVERLAPBDYDISJOINT``, ``OVERLAPBDYINTERSECT``, ``EQUAL``, "
"``INSIDE``, ``COVEREDBY``, ``CONTAINS``, ``COVERS``, ``ON`` och "
"``ANYINTERACT``.   Flera strängar kan kombineras med den logiska booleska "
"operatorn OR, till exempel ``'inside+touch'``. [#fnsdorelate]_ "
"Relationssträngarna är okänsliga för stora och små bokstäver."

