msgstr "Attribut för ``BoundField``"

msgid ""
"Returns an ``aria-describedby`` reference to associate a field with its help "
"text and errors. Returns ``None`` if ``aria-describedby`` is set "
"in :attr:`Widget.attrs` to preserve the user defined attribute when "
