msgstr "Anpassa ``BoundField``"

msgid ""
"Define a custom :class:`~django.forms.BoundField` class to use when "
"rendering the form. This takes precedence over the project-"
"level :attr:`.BaseRenderer.bound_field_class` (along with a "
"custom :setting:`FORM_RENDERER`), but can be overridden by the field-"
"level :attr:`.Field.bound_field_class`."
msgstr ""
"Definiera en anpassad :class:`~django.forms.BoundField`-klass som ska "
