"number formats vary so much around the world. You can add some by setting "
"``pattern``, ``minlength``, or ``maxlength`` in the :attr:`Widget.attrs` "
"argument."
msgstr ""
"Webbläsare utför ingen validering på klientsidan som standard eftersom "
