"This example excludes all entries whose ``pub_date`` is later than 2005-1-3 "
"OR whose headline is \"Hello\"::"
msgstr ""
"Detta exempel utesluter alla poster vars ``pub_date`` är senare än 2005-1-3 "
"ELLER vars rubrik är \"Hello\"::"

