"a reference to a field on the model (or any related models), via ``F()``;"
msgstr ""
"en referens till ett fält i modellen (eller eventuella relaterade modeller), "
"via ``F()``;"

msgid "a boolean, via ``Q()``; or"
msgstr "en boolean, via ``Q()``; eller"

