msgid "``resolve()``"
msgstr "``resolve()``"

msgid ""
"The ``resolve()`` function can be used for resolving URL paths to the "
"corresponding view functions. It has the following signature:"
msgstr ""
"Funktionen ``resolve()`` kan användas för att lösa upp URL-sökvägar till "
