"If ``value`` is ``\"<b>Joel</b> <button>is</button> a <span>slug</span>\"`` "
"the return value will be ``\"Joel is a slug\"``."
msgstr ""
"Om ``value`` är ``<b>\"Joel</b> <button>is</button> a <span>slug</span>\"`` "
