msgid ""
"Returns a :class:`~datetime.tzinfo` instance that represents "
"the :ref:`current time zone <default-current-time-zone>`."
msgstr ""
"Returnerar en :class:`~datetime.tzinfo`-instans som "
"representerar :ref:`aktuell tidszon <default-current-time-zone>`."

msgid ""
"Returns the name of the :ref:`current time zone <default-current-time-zone>`."
msgstr ""
